  "description": "Trident – The Ultimate Family Tandem\nThe Trident is designed with family-friendly PeriScope technology, making it one of the most adjustable and versatile tandem bikes available. With quick and easy adjustments, it accommodates a wide range of riders, so you can start riding with your kids early and keep them close for safety, adventure, and fun. Built for stability, durability, and comfort, the Trident is perfect for family rides, touring, and everyday adventures.\nWith rack and fender mounts and excellent load-handling capabilities, this three-person tandem is as practical as it is fun. Whether you're cruising through town or gearing up for a long-distance ride, the Trident delivers a smooth, reliable experience for all riders and a piece of mind for the captain.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 26” wheels with 30-40mm tires for stability and comfort\n\nCo-Motion zonally-butted chromoly tubing for durability and performance\n\nOversized 44mm head tube & unicrown touring fork for enhanced handling\n\nSure and steady handling designed for three riders\n\nProven Co-Motion touring geometry for a smooth, confident ride\n\nRack & fender mounts for added versatility and load-carrying\n\nPowerful dual disc brakes for superior stopping power\n\nShimano 105 drivetrain for smooth and reliable shifting\n\nHand-built touring wheels for long-lasting performance\n\nWhether you're riding as a duo or a trio, the Trident Tandem is built to grow with your family and provide endless riding adventures.\n\nComplete bike starting at $8,295.00\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion PeriScope Trident order started!",
